; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">) 10:00~17:00 (</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">교육일시 중 각 영역별로 참여</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">)</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">교육방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">온라인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(ZOOM) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">비대면 교육 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">신청자에게 별도 입장주소 안내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">모집인원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: 150</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">명</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">교육비</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">전액무료</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">바</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">교육내용</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmFYHoQDkhbAmgFwOYEcDyAVbAvdAEQDcBJRVACQHsA5ARQDMA6AKQAUBxIA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"text-align: center; clear: none; float: none;\"></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">교육신청</span><br></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">신청기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">:<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"> <b>2025.08.13.(</b></span></span><b><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">) 10:00 ~ 2025.08.25.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">) 13:00</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">까지</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">신청방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">학생역량관리시스템</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(<span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><b>BISKIT</b></span>) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">프로그램 신청</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">문의처</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">학생성공처 취업지원팀 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">☎</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">054-478-7985)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">★</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">공기업반</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">대기업반을 세부 영역별로 운영하오니 희망하는 영역을 선택하여 각각 신청해주세요</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">중복 신청 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">!!!)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">★</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">*</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">본 프로그램 신청 후</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">참여를 못</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">할 경우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">프로그램</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">시작 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">일전까지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">취소 부탁드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">*</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">프로그램을 취소하지 않고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">불참 시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">프로그램 시작일로부터</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;3</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">개월간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">대학일자리플러스센터</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">취업지원팀 프로그램</